@HostAddress = http://10.0.128.222:5104
@Token = YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN

### Health check
GET {{HostAddress}}/health

### Get list
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Get by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "tx_manual_001",
  "amount": 50000,
  "type": "expense",
  "source": "VietinBank",
  "bankName": "VietinBank",
  "packageName": "",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-29T10:00:00+07:00",
  "categoryName": "Đồ ăn",
  "note": "Test tay"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
